0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
39.6850393700787407 626.4569291338582389 Td
(This technical case study presents the end-to-end architecture, configuration, and validation playbook for integrating 3D Mechanical CAD) Tj
T* (\(Siemens NX\) with Enterprise Resource Planning \(SAP ERP\) via Siemens Teamcenter 2606 and Active Integration Gateway \(AIG / T4S\).) Tj
T* (Designed by FATEQ Technologies, this implementation blueprint solves persistent shop-floor data corruption, manual CSV export bottlenecks,) Tj
T* (duplicate material master creation, and unaligned Engineering Bills of Materials \(EBOM\) versus Manufacturing BOMs \(MBOM\). By establishing an) Tj
T* (automated, bi-directional digital thread, the solution enforces pre-transfer data validation, ECLASS CST classification checks, asynchronous) Tj
T* (transaction queueing, and automated error recovery workflows.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Key Technical Outcome: Achieved 99.8% transactional success rate across 15,000+ monthly material master and BOM synchronization) Tj
T* (transactions, eliminated manual data entry efforts by 85%, and enforced zero duplicate material creation across multi-site ERP plants.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
