(In the baseline operational state, engineering teams authored CAD models in Siemens NX and manually exported BOM structures into flat CSV) Tj
T* (files. Manufacturing planners then manually re-keyed these attributes into SAP ERP to create Material Masters \(MARA/MAKT\) and Plant BOMs) Tj
T* (\(STKO/STPO\). This disconnected handover introduced four critical enterprise vulnerabilities:) Tj
