(The project scope defined a fully automated, event-driven integration framework between Siemens Teamcenter 2606 Active Workspace and SAP) Tj
T* (ERP using the Siemens Active Integration Gateway \(AIG\) / Teamcenter Integration Framework \(TcIF\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (In-Scope Architecture:) Tj
T* (• Bi-directional attribute synchronization between NX CAD properties, Teamcenter Item Revisions, and SAP Material Masters.) Tj
T* (• Automated EBOM structure validation \(mass, status, material classification\) prior to triggering ERP release workflows.) Tj
T* (• AIG / T4S mapping procedure configuration \(T4S_MAPPING_MATERIAL_MASTER, T4S_MAPPING_BOM_HEADER\).) Tj
T* (• Automated error queue handling with active notification workflows to PLM data stewards.) Tj
T* (• Scheduled night-way delta reconciliation scripts between Teamcenter database read-replicas and SAP OData endpoints.) Tj
