(Prior to initiating the AIG transfer, the Teamcenter Workflow Designer executes an automated pre-flight rule handler \(EPM-check-action-handler\). The) Tj
T* (workflow verifies that: \(1\) All BOM line items hold TCM Released status, \(2\) No parts contain zero mass, \(3\) All standard hardware items are classified in) Tj
T* (ECLASS CST, and \(4\) Secondary 3D JT and PDF viewable datasets are fully attached.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (C. AIG / T4S Data Transfer & Exception Queueing:) Tj
T* (The Active Integration Gateway parses the validated Teamcenter BOM structure into structured TCL/XML payloads. The mapping procedures) Tj
T* (\(T4S_MAPPING_MATERIAL_MASTER and T4S_MAPPING_BOM_HEADER\) execute remote function calls \(RFC\) to SAP. If a network or database lock) Tj
T* (occurs, the transaction is logged in the AIG Job Monitor and queued for automated retry \(up to 3 attempts\) before triggering a task escalation to the PLM) Tj
T* (System Administrator.) Tj
